 data-bigb=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;top:8%;right:-4%;width:min(460px,32vw);opacity:.055;pointer-events:none\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bbxmch8nw83g.webp\" style=\"width:100%;display:block\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"548\" height=\"660\"><\/div>\r\n<div data-wrap=\"\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:2\">\r\n<div data-sechead=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"max-width:900px;margin:0 auto\">\r\n<p data-crumb=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 12.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#7C8074;margin-bottom:22px\"><a href=\"\/\" style=\"color:#7C8074\">Home<\/a> <span style=\"color:#DCC79B\">\/<\/span> About Us<\/p>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:500 11px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B2934F;margin-bottom:20px\">Who We Are<\/p>\r\n<h1 data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 clamp(34px,5vw,64px)\/1.1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#576045\">Dental care that goes <em style=\"font-style:italic;color:#7C8663\">beyond<\/em><\/h1>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin:26px 0 24px\">\r\n<span style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:#DCC79B\"><\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bbxmch8nw83g.webp\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;object-fit:contain\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"548\" height=\"660\"><span style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:#DCC79B\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 17px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:62ch\">Braces &amp; Beyond is a specialist led orthodontic and multidisciplinary dental practice in DHA 1, Islamabad, built around careful diagnosis, individualized planning and a patient first experience.<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 1. INTRODUCTION ===== -->\r\n<!-- ===== OUR PRACTICE =====\r\n     REVISION 6: image block only.\r\n       - Second image (bbxgfed84ep9.jpg) removed entirely.\r\n       - The team photo is now a single centered block, capped at 860px so it\r\n         doesn't stretch edge-to-edge inside the 1340px wrapper.\r\n       - The forced 4\/3.2 crop is gone. A group photo loses faces at the edges\r\n         when it's force-cropped, so the image now keeps its own aspect ratio\r\n         (width:100%;height:auto). Nothing gets cut on any screen size.\r\n       - The gold offset frame, the rounded corners and the shadow are exactly\r\n         as before; only the layout around them changed.\r\n       - data-2col removed \u2014 with one image there is no second column, so the\r\n         flex row was doing nothing except adding a wrap point.\r\n     Heading, copy and rule above are untouched. -->\r\n<section style=\"padding:clamp(50px,7vw,96px) 0\">\r\n<div data-wrap=\"\">\r\n<div data-sechead=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto clamp(38px,5vw,56px)\">\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:500 11px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B2934F;margin-bottom:18px\">Our Practice<\/p>\r\n<h2 data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)\/1.14 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#3E4530\">A clinic built around the patient<\/h2>\r\n<span data-rule=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:#C2A469;margin:22px auto\"><\/span>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:64ch;margin-bottom:18px\">At Braces &amp; Beyond, treatment is about more than straightening teeth. Our approach combines careful diagnosis, specialist expertise and individualized planning to create healthier bites and confident smiles.<\/p>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:64ch;margin-bottom:18px\">From a child's first orthodontic assessment to adult braces, clear aligners and more complex concerns, every treatment journey begins with understanding the patient first.<\/p>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:64ch\">The clinic brings orthodontic, surgical and restorative expertise into one coordinated setting, so cases that need more than one perspective receive it under one roof.<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"position:relative;width:100%;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px\">\r\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid #DCC79B;border-radius:30px;pointer-events:none\"><\/div>\r\n<div style=\"position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#EDE9DC,#EDE9DC 8px,#F5F2E8 8px,#F5F2E8 16px);box-shadow:0 44px 80px -46px rgba(62,69,48,.6)\">\r\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Braces and Beyond team\" onerror=\"this.style.visibility='hidden'\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Braces-Beyond-Team-scaled.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"844\" height=\"900\">\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 2. LEADERSHIP ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"leadership\" style=\"background:#F7F4EC;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,96px) 0\">\r\n<div data-wrap=\"\">\r\n<div data-sechead=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto clamp(38px,5vw,54px)\">\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:500 11px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B2934F;margin-bottom:18px\">Leadership<\/p>\r\n<h2 data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)\/1.14 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#3E4530\">Led by <em style=\"font-style:italic;color:#7C8663\">Brig. (R) Dr. Azhar Ali Bangash<\/em><\/h2>\r\n<span data-rule=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:#C2A469;margin:22px auto\"><\/span>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:62ch\">One clinic lead, supported by a multidisciplinary team, so every plan is consistent from the first consultation to the final review.<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div data-2col=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(32px,4.5vw,64px)\">\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:0 1 400px;min-width:280px;position:relative;padding:10px\">\r\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid #DCC79B;border-radius:30px;pointer-events:none\"><\/div>\r\n<div style=\"position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#EDE9DC,#EDE9DC 8px,#F5F2E8 8px,#F5F2E8 16px);box-shadow:0 44px 80px -46px rgba(62,69,48,.6)\">\r\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Brig. (R) Prof. Dr. Azhar Ali Bangash\" onerror=\"this.style.visibility='hidden'\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Brig.-R-Dr.-Azhar-Ali-Bangash-scaled.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1\/1.1;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 20%;display:block\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\">\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 440px;min-width:280px\">\r\n<h3 style=\"font:400 clamp(24px,2.8vw,34px)\/1.2 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#3E4530\">Brig. (R) Prof. Dr. Azhar Ali Bangash<\/h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;font:500 10.5px\/1.5 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C8663\">BDS, MCPS, FCPS (Orthodontics), CHPE<\/p>\r\n<span style=\"display:block;width:44px;height:2px;background:#C2A469;margin:20px 0\"><\/span>\r\n<p style=\"font:400 16px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:58ch;margin-bottom:16px\">Dr. Azhar leads Braces &amp; Beyond as a specialist orthodontist, bringing extensive clinical and academic experience to detailed treatment planning and functional correction across both straightforward and complex cases.<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"font:400 16px\/1.8 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:58ch\">He sets the clinical standard the whole team works to, reviews complex plans personally, and keeps diagnosis at the centre of every decision the clinic makes.<\/p>\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px\">\r\n<span data-chip=\"\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#FFFDF7;color:#4A5438;border:1px solid #E8E1CE;border-radius:999px;padding:11px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 18px -12px rgba(35,36,31,.45),0 1px 0 #fff inset;transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:#B2934F\"><\/i>Orthodontics<\/span>\r\n<span data-chip=\"\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#FFFDF7;color:#4A5438;border:1px solid #E8E1CE;border-radius:999px;padding:11px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 18px -12px rgba(35,36,31,.45),0 1px 0 #fff inset;transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:#B2934F\"><\/i>Functional correction<\/span>\r\n<span data-chip=\"\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#FFFDF7;color:#4A5438;border:1px solid #E8E1CE;border-radius:999px;padding:11px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 18px -12px rgba(35,36,31,.45),0 1px 0 #fff inset;transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:#B2934F\"><\/i>Complex planning<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 3. VALUES ===== -->\r\n<section style=\"padding:clamp(56px,7vw,96px) 0\">\r\n<div data-wrap=\"\">\r\n<div data-sechead=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto clamp(38px,5vw,58px)\">\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:500 11px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B2934F;margin-bottom:20px\">Our Values<\/p>\r\n<h2 data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 clamp(30px,4vw,50px)\/1.12 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#3E4530\">Specialist Care.<br><em style=\"font-style:italic;color:#7C8663\">Thoughtfully<\/em> Delivered.<\/h2>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin:24px 0 26px\">\r\n<span style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:#DCC79B\"><\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bbxmch8nw83g.webp\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;object-fit:contain\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"548\" height=\"660\"><span style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:#DCC79B\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:60ch\">Five principles shape how every plan is made and every appointment runs.<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div data-3grid=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;perspective:1800px;perspective-origin:50% 0%\">\r\n\r\n<article data-lift3d=\"9\" data-base=\"perspective(1200px) rotateX(5deg)\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(168deg,#FFFDF7,#F6F2E6);border:1px solid #EBE5D4;padding:30px 28px 28px;transform:perspective(1200px) rotateX(5deg);transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .55s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .55s,border-color .45s;box-shadow:0 1px 0 #f